{"id": "f22231c8-d67b-4ccc-9019-849b75215272", "slug": "aurelia-nexus-control-1", "title": "Aurelia Nexus Control", "description": "Aurelia Nexus Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Aurelia Nexus Control\"\ndescription: \"Aurelia Nexus Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#F59E0B\"\n  secondary: \"#404040\"\n  accent: \"#FDEFD8\"\n  background: \"#08080A\"\n  surface: \"#404040\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#404040\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"DM Sans\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"11px\"\n  control: \"11px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Aurelia Nexus Control\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Samnang Aing (@samnang). Views: 45; favorites: 10; remixes: 0.\nTags: feature, section, animated, bento.\n## Overview\nAurelia Nexus Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nData Link Routing The Nexus Stream Core data pathways manifest optimal routing sequences when infrastructure constraints are lifted. Signal clarity emerges in the silent execution of high-fidelity subroutines across the…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Routing The Nexus Stream; Synchronizing Mainframe State; Structural Frame Integrity Status Nominal.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #F59E0B, secondary #404040, accent #FDEFD8, background #08080A, surface #404040, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and DM Sans for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Aurelia Nexus Control</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n    <style>\n        /* Custom font import for Google Sans Flex equivalent (using closely related system/google sans stack) */\n        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:opsz,wght@9..40,300;9..40,400&display=swap');\n\n        .font-brand {\n            font-family: \"DM Sans\", \"Google Sans Flex\", system-ui, sans-serif;\n        }\n\n        /* Utility for the gradient mask shell technique */\n        .gradient-shell-mask {\n            -webkit-mask: linear-gradient(#fff 0 0) content-box, linear-gradient(#fff 0 0);\n            -webkit-mask-composite: xor;\n            mask-composite: exclude;\n        }\n\n        /* Tactile Hardware Inner Shadow */\n        .tactile-surface {\n            box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.05), 0 10px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);\n        }\n\n        .tactile-surface-elevated {\n            box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.1), 0 40px 80px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"antialiased min-h-screen overflow-x-hidden relative bg-[#08080A] text-[#A3A3A3] font-sans selection:bg-[#F59E0B]/30 selection:text-[#FDEFD8]\" style=\"font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\">\n\n    <!-- WebGL Particle Field Fallback Canvas -->\n    <canvas id=\"glcanvas\" class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none opacity-60 mix-blend-screen\"></canvas>\n\n    <!-- Structural Grid Rails -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none flex justify-center w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto opacity-20\">\n        <div class=\"w-1/5 h-full border-r border-[#404040]\"></div>\n        <div class=\"w-1/5 h-full border-r border-[#404040]\"></div>\n        <div class=\"w-1/5 h-full border-r border-[#404040]\"></div>\n        <div class=\"w-1/5 h-full border-r border-[#404040]\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Main Container Framed Grid Layout -->\n    <main class=\"w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center p-6 md:p-10 lg:p-16 relative\">\n\n        <!-- Grid Structure -->\n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8 lg:gap-6 w-full relative z-10\">\n\n            <!-- Card 1: Telemetry -->\n            <article class=\"p-[1px] rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-b from-[#404040] to-[#111] group transition-all duration-500 hover:-translate-y-[1px] relative z-10 shadow-[0_2px_10px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)]\">\n                <!-- Inner Tactile Surface -->\n                <div class=\"h-full bg-[#08080A]/80 backdrop-blur-md rounded-[11px] p-6 flex flex-col relative overflow-hidden tactile-surface\">\n\n                    <!-- Corner Framing Motifs -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-3 left-3 w-2 h-2 border-t border-l border-[#404040] pointer-events-none transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:border-[#F59E0B]/50\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute bottom-3 right-3 w-2 h-2 border-b border-r border-[#404040] pointer-events-none transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:border-[#F59E0B]/50\"></div>\n\n                    <!-- Media -->\n                    <div class=\"relative w-full aspect-[4/5] overflow-hidden rounded-sm border border-[#333] bg-[#030303]\">\n                        <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/00c04d78-570e-4b05-8505-61ed6e914fc1_3840w.webp\" alt=\"Landscape\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover filter grayscale opacity-70 mix-blend-luminosity transition-transform duration-1000 group-hover:scale-105 will-change-transform\">\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent to-[#08080A]/80 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n                        <!-- Tags -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute top-4 left-4 flex gap-2 z-10\">\n                            <span class=\"px-3 py-1 text-xs font-light text-[#D4D4D4] bg-[#050505]/80 backdrop-blur-md border border-[#444] rounded-sm transition-colors duration-300 hover:bg-[#111]\">Data Link</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Content -->\n                    <div class=\"mt-8 flex flex-col flex-1 pb-2\">\n                        <h2 class=\"text-4xl leading-tight tracking-tight font-light text-[#F5F5F5] font-brand\">\n                            <div class=\"overflow-hidden pb-1\"><div class=\"gs-reveal translate-y-full\">Routing The</div></div>\n                            <div class=\"overflow-hidden pb-1\"><div class=\"gs-reveal translate-y-full text-[#A3A3A3]\">Nexus Stream</div></div>\n                        </h2>\n\n                        <div class=\"mt-6 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#A3A3A3] font-light flex-1\">\n                            <p>Core data pathways manifest optimal routing sequences when infrastructure constraints are lifted. Signal clarity emerges in the silent execution of high-fidelity subroutines across the distributed network.</p>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"mt-6 flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-[#7F5206] transition-colors group-hover:text-[#F59E0B]\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" class=\"text-sm\"></iconify-icon>\n                            <span class=\"uppercase tracking-widest cursor-pointer hover:text-[#FDEFD8]\">Architectures</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </article>\n\n            <!-- Card 2: Mainframe (Elevated) -->\n            <article class=\"p-[1px] rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-b from-[#F59E0B]/60 to-[#111] group transition-all duration-500 hover:-translate-y-[1px] relative z-20 md:-mt-6 md:mb-6 lg:-mt-10 lg:mb-10 shadow-[0_20px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.6),0_0_15px_rgba(245,158,11,0.15)]\">\n                <!-- Inner Tactile Surface -->\n                <div class=\"h-full bg-[#08080A]/95 backdrop-blur-xl rounded-[11px] p-8 flex flex-col relative overflow-hidden tactile-surface-elevated\">\n\n                    <!-- Corner Framing Motifs -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-3 left-3 w-2 h-2 border-t border-l border-[#F59E0B]/40 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-3 right-3 w-2 h-2 border-t border-r border-[#F59E0B]/40 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute bottom-3 left-3 w-2 h-2 border-b border-l border-[#F59E0B]/40 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute bottom-3 right-3 w-2 h-2 border-b border-r border-[#F59E0B]/40 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n                    <!-- Header Bar -->\n                    <header class=\"flex justify-between items-center pb-4 border-b border-[#333] mb-6 text-[#D4D4D4]\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:server-square-linear\" class=\"text-2xl text-[#F59E0B]\"></iconify-icon>\n                        <span class=\"text-xs tracking-widest font-light uppercase text-[#898989]\">Core Uplink</span>\n                    </header>\n\n                    <!-- Content Area -->\n                    <div class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col\">\n                        <h2 class=\"text-5xl leading-tight tracking-tight font-light font-brand\">\n                            <div class=\"overflow-hidden pb-1\"><div class=\"gs-reveal translate-y-full text-[#F5F5F5]\">Synchronizing</div></div>\n                            <div class=\"overflow-hidden pb-1\"><div class=\"gs-reveal translate-y-full text-[#F59E0B]\">Mainframe State</div></div>\n                        </h2>\n\n                        <!-- Media -->\n                        <div class=\"mt-8 relative w-full aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden rounded-sm border border-[#404040] bg-[#020202]\">\n                            <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/0bf364af-8ad0-4435-b229-5c48843e8db2_3840w.webp\" alt=\"Abstract Data Flow\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover opacity-60 filter grayscale contrast-125 transition-transform duration-1000 group-hover:scale-105 will-change-transform mix-blend-lighten\">\n                            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[#08080A]/20 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n                            <!-- Node Ping Indicator -->\n                            <div class=\"absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 flex items-center justify-center\">\n                                <div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#F59E0B] z-10\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-[#F59E0B] absolute animate-ping opacity-20\"></div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Tags -->\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-6\">\n                            <span class=\"px-3 py-1 text-xs font-light text-[#F59E0B] border border-[#F59E0B]/30 bg-[#F59E0B]/5 rounded-sm shadow-sm transition-colors duration-300 hover:bg-[#F59E0B]/10\">Active Grid</span>\n                            <span class=\"px-3 py-1 text-xs font-light text-[#D4D4D4] border border-[#444] bg-[#111] rounded-sm shadow-sm transition-colors duration-300 hover:bg-[#222]\">Quantum</span>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Meta -->\n                        <div class=\"mt-8 flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-[#898989] font-light tracking-wide border-l-2 border-[#444] pl-3\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:shield-user-linear\" class=\"text-sm\"></iconify-icon>\n                            SysAdmin <span class=\"mx-1 opacity-50\">/</span> 4ms latency\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Content -->\n                        <div class=\"mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#A3A3A3] font-light pb-4\">\n                            <p>Upon connection validation, deep-state diagnostic layers compile immediately. The tactical console doesn't merely track input; it translates systemic anomalies into actionable, high-performance UI resolution logic.</p>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Actions -->\n                        <div class=\"mt-auto pt-6 border-t border-[#333] flex items-center justify-between\">\n                            <button class=\"flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-2.5 bg-[#FBBF24] text-[#000000] border border-[#FBBF24] rounded-lg text-sm font-normal shadow-[inset_0_1px_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.4),0_4px_10px_rgba(245,158,11,0.2)] transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-[#F59E0B] hover:translate-y-[1px] active:scale-95\">\n                                Activate Grid\n                            </button>\n                            <button class=\"flex items-center justify-center px-4 py-1.5 bg-transparent text-[#F5F5F5] border border-[#444] rounded-md text-xs font-normal shadow-[inset_0_1px_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.15),0_2px_4px_rgba(0,0,0,0.6)] transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-[#111] hover:border-[#F59E0B]/50 hover:translate-y-[1px]\">\n                                Initialize Core\n                            </button>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </article>\n\n            <!-- Card 3: Structural Integrity -->\n            <article class=\"p-[1px] rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-b from-[#404040] to-[#111] group transition-all duration-500 hover:-translate-y-[1px] relative z-10 shadow-[0_2px_10px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)]\">\n                <!-- Inner Tactile Surface -->\n                <div class=\"h-full bg-[#08080A]/80 backdrop-blur-md rounded-[11px] p-6 flex flex-col relative overflow-hidden tactile-surface\">\n\n                    <!-- Corner Framing Motifs -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-3 left-3 w-2 h-2 border-t border-l border-[#404040] pointer-events-none transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:border-[#F59E0B]/50\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute bottom-3 right-3 w-2 h-2 border-b border-r border-[#404040] pointer-events-none transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:border-[#F59E0B]/50\"></div>\n\n                    <!-- Media -->\n                    <div class=\"relative w-full aspect-[4/5] overflow-hidden rounded-sm border border-[#333] bg-[#030303]\">\n                        <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/7df94c66-5d1e-4235-a476-1d2d8881a456_3840w.jpg\" alt=\"Structure\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover filter grayscale opacity-60 transition-transform duration-1000 group-hover:scale-105 will-change-transform mix-blend-luminosity\">\n\n                        <!-- Tags -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute top-4 left-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2 z-10\">\n                            <span class=\"px-3 py-1 text-xs font-light text-[#D4D4D4] bg-[#050505]/80 backdrop-blur-md border border-[#444] rounded-sm transition-colors duration-300 hover:bg-[#111]\">Architecture</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Content -->\n                    <div class=\"mt-8 flex flex-col flex-1 pb-2\">\n                        <h2 class=\"text-4xl leading-tight tracking-tight font-light text-[#F5F5F5] font-brand\">\n                            <div class=\"overflow-hidden pb-1\"><div class=\"gs-reveal translate-y-full\">Structural</div></div>\n                            <div class=\"overflow-hidden pb-1\"><div class=\"gs-reveal translate-y-full text-[#A3A3A3]\">Frame Integrity</div></div>\n                            <div class=\"overflow-hidden pb-1\"><div class=\"gs-reveal translate-y-full text-[#898989] text-2xl mt-1\">Status Nominal</div></div>\n                        </h2>\n\n                        <!-- Meta -->\n                        <div class=\"mt-6 flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-[#898989] font-light tracking-wide border-l-2 border-[#444] pl-3\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:shield-user-linear\" class=\"text-sm\"></iconify-icon>\n                            Auth Node <span class=\"mx-1 opacity-50\">/</span> Secure\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#A3A3A3] font-light flex-1\">\n                            <p>Isolating critical load-bearing virtual instances ensures complete fault tolerance. The minimal framework deliberately trims excess metadata, leaving a resilient structure capable of withstanding dynamic operational shifts.</p>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"mt-6 flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-[#7F5206] transition-colors group-hover:text-[#F59E0B]\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" class=\"text-sm\"></iconify-icon>\n                            <span class=\"uppercase tracking-widest cursor-pointer hover:text-[#FDEFD8]\">Architectures</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </article>\n\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script>\n        // WebGL Particle Field Simulation (Canvas 2D)\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", () => {\n            const canvas = document.getElementById('glcanvas');\n            const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\n            let width, height;\n            let particles = [];\n            let mouseX = window.innerWidth / 2;\n            let mouseY = window.innerHeight / 2;\n\n            // Initialization\n            function initParticles() {\n                width = canvas.width = window.innerWidth;\n                height = canvas.height = window.innerHeight;\n                particles = [];\n                // Sparse grid spacing\n                const spacing = 45;\n                for (let x = 0; x < width; x += spacing) {\n                    for (let y = 0; y < height; y += spacing) {\n                        particles.push({\n                            x: x,\n                            y: y,\n                            baseX: x,\n                            baseY: y,\n                            noiseOffset: Math.random() * Math.PI * 2\n                        });\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n\n            window.addEventListener('resize', initParticles);\n            window.addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => {\n                mouseX = e.clientX;\n                mouseY = e.clientY;\n            });\n            initParticles();\n\n            let time = 0;\n            function animateCanvas() {\n                ctx.clearRect(0, 0, width, height);\n                time += 0.015;\n\n                // Meditative breathing pulse\n                const globalPulse = (Math.sin(time) + 1) / 2;\n\n                particles.forEach(p => {\n                    // Pointer interactive drift\n                    let dx = mouseX - p.baseX;\n                    let dy = mouseY - p.baseY;\n                    let dist = Math.sqrt(dx * dx + dy * dy);\n\n                    // Soft depth and force fade\n                    let force = Math.max(0, 300 - dist) / 300;\n\n                    p.x = p.baseX - dx * force * 0.08;\n                    p.y = p.baseY - dy * force * 0.08;\n\n                    // Individual twinkling / noise\n                    let localPulse = (Math.sin(time * 2 + p.noiseOffset) + 1) / 2;\n                    let size = 0.8 + (localPulse * 0.5) + (force * 1.5);\n                    let alpha = 0.1 + (localPulse * 0.2) + (force * 0.4);\n\n                    // Green on black theme\n                    ctx.fillStyle = `rgba(34, 197, 94, ${alpha})`;\n                    ctx.beginPath();\n                    ctx.arc(p.x, p.y, size, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n                    ctx.fill();\n                });\n\n                requestAnimationFrame(animateCanvas);\n            }\n            animateCanvas();\n\n            // GSAP Scroll Animations\n            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n            const revealElements = document.querySelectorAll('.gs-reveal');\n            revealElements.forEach((element, index) => {\n                gsap.to(element, {\n                    scrollTrigger: {\n                        trigger: element.closest('article'),\n                        start: \"top 85%\",\n                        toggleActions: \"play none none none\"\n                    },\n                    y: \"0%\",\n                    duration: 1.0,\n                    ease: \"power4.out\",\n                    delay: index * 0.1\n                });\n            });\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "aurelia-nexus-control-1.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/aurelia-nexus-control-1.jpg", "source_name": "aurelia-nexus-control-1-DESIGN.md", "views": 159, "forks": 2, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "66a84ecf-0972-40f3-8a4c-15b11d3aee0a", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-02T20:38:53.73923+00:00"}